<title>USA: TCW Group to unveil large high-yield fund - WSJ.</title>
<headline>TCW Group to unveil large high-yield fund - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCW Group Inc will unveil the second-biggest high-yield investment fund ever on Wednesday, the Wall Street Journal said in today's electronic edition.</p>
<p>TCW Leveraged Income Trust LP, a $1.05 billion fund, will be a private loan and a securities pool run by Los Angeles-based TCW Group, the parent of Trust Company of the West, a money manager, the paper said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
